WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.033 --> 00:00:02.434
-Welcome back to "Late Night."

00:00:02.434 --> 00:00:04.567
We're here with Paula Pell,
one of the stars of "Girls5eva."

00:00:04.567 --> 00:00:06.634
You actually encountered
somebody

00:00:06.634 --> 00:00:09.601
who had road rage towards you.

00:00:09.601 --> 00:00:13.734
-Yes, I had something happen out
in Los Angeles a few years ago,

00:00:13.734 --> 00:00:16.400
where I was on Sepulveda, and if
you've never been to L.A.,

00:00:16.400 --> 00:00:17.601
it's, you know, a lot --
[ Light applause ]

00:00:17.601 --> 00:00:20.501
Someone's like, "Sepulveda!"
[ Laughter ]

00:00:20.501 --> 00:00:24.601
It's along the main highway,
but it's like another side road,

00:00:24.601 --> 00:00:27.000
sort of a frontage road,
as they would say.

00:00:27.000 --> 00:00:28.634
But it has a lot of lights.

00:00:28.634 --> 00:00:32.167
And so, you know, if the traffic
is in complete hell --

00:00:32.167 --> 00:00:34.334
Friday-afternoon hell,
you're never going anywhere.

00:00:34.334 --> 00:00:37.067
You're just waiting for the next
light, and then you scoot up

00:00:37.067 --> 00:00:39.200
like seven feet and then you
scoot up seven feet.

00:00:39.200 --> 00:00:40.968
So it takes forever and ever,

00:00:40.968 --> 00:00:43.334
and you age many years
in the car in L.A.

00:00:43.334 --> 00:00:45.534
And so I was in the car,
going home,

00:00:45.534 --> 00:00:48.334
perfectly good mood on a Friday.

00:00:48.334 --> 00:00:53.367
And I'm driving, and I look back
in my rearview mirror,

00:00:53.367 --> 00:00:57.567
and this guy is losing his mind,
screaming at who I thought was

00:00:57.567 --> 00:01:00.601
driving next to him, and he had
this red brand-new Cadillac.

00:01:00.601 --> 00:01:05.901
He had, you know, a suit on.
Very, you know, cleaned-up.

00:01:05.901 --> 00:01:07.667
And he was just losing his mind.

00:01:07.667 --> 00:01:09.868
I'm like, "Ooh, this is
something fun to watch.

00:01:09.868 --> 00:01:11.667
You know, it's a good television
show to watch."

00:01:11.667 --> 00:01:14.634
And so I'm, like, kind of
checking out, laughing about it.

00:01:14.634 --> 00:01:18.033
And then I see him peel up next
to me, and he's screaming at me.

00:01:18.033 --> 00:01:21.033
He's screaming at me
through the closed window.

00:01:21.033 --> 00:01:23.167
And so I finally was
just like...

00:01:23.167 --> 00:01:26.934
I did my window and I said,
"What's your issue?

00:01:26.934 --> 00:01:28.033
What's your problem?"

00:01:28.033 --> 00:01:29.601
And he said -- Get ready, guys.

00:01:29.601 --> 00:01:31.133
There aren't kids here, right?

00:01:31.133 --> 00:01:33.968
He said, "Say one more word,
you fat [bleep]"

00:01:33.968 --> 00:01:36.167
-Ooh!
[ Audience groans ]

00:01:36.167 --> 00:01:39.033
-And here's my thing.
[ Laughter ]

00:01:39.033 --> 00:01:44.167
I do not care for a fat-person
male making a fat woman --

00:01:44.167 --> 00:01:46.834
calling her fat, because
this guy was fatter than me.

00:01:46.834 --> 00:01:50.434
So I turn to him and I go,
"You're calling me fat?!"

00:01:50.434 --> 00:01:53.300
That was my first thing.
I said, "You're calling me fat?"

00:01:53.300 --> 00:01:57.100
And he had what I like to call,
I named it a "furtle-neck,"

00:01:57.100 --> 00:02:00.601
which is when you're fat
and you grow a beard --

00:02:00.601 --> 00:02:03.267
a guy grows a beard
in that fat part under here.

00:02:03.267 --> 00:02:04.467
[ Laughter ]

00:02:04.467 --> 00:02:06.167
And it's kind of like
nature's shading.

00:02:06.167 --> 00:02:08.501
It's like trying to shade.
[ Laughter ]

00:02:08.501 --> 00:02:09.834
It's like, "I'm not buying it.

00:02:09.834 --> 00:02:11.701
I can see the lobster roll
under the hair."

00:02:11.701 --> 00:02:16.567
But so I got so crazy mad
at him,

00:02:16.567 --> 00:02:19.000
and I was just, like, beyond.

00:02:19.000 --> 00:02:21.300
And we weren't going anywhere.
It wasn't like, you know --

00:02:21.300 --> 00:02:25.100
And so I just turned to him
and I went...[ Chuckles ]

00:02:25.100 --> 00:02:26.968
"Well, guess what, buddy.

00:02:26.968 --> 00:02:30.334
It's your lucky day because I'm
a police officer."

00:02:30.334 --> 00:02:33.901
[ Laughter and applause ]

00:02:33.901 --> 00:02:36.501
And he's like, "You are not!"

00:02:36.501 --> 00:02:38.701
And I go, "Spin the wheel, baby,
spin the wheel."

00:02:38.701 --> 00:02:41.167
[ Laughter ]

00:02:41.167 --> 00:02:46.234
And so then what I did, every
light, was create a tableau of

00:02:46.234 --> 00:02:49.133
something I was doing that
looked police-officer-like...

00:02:49.133 --> 00:02:50.334
[ Laughter ]

00:02:50.334 --> 00:02:54.133
...so he would fecalize
his suit pants

00:02:54.133 --> 00:02:55.501
and get really scared.

00:02:55.501 --> 00:02:59.434
So every time we'd get to
another light, I'd be like...

00:02:59.434 --> 00:03:03.367
[ Laughter ]

00:03:03.367 --> 00:03:05.367
And I have a good kind of
dikey cop energy,

00:03:05.367 --> 00:03:08.234
so you know it was viable.
[ Laughter ]

00:03:08.234 --> 00:03:12.767
And every single time
we got to another light,

00:03:12.767 --> 00:03:15.667
and I kind of started running
out of things,

00:03:15.667 --> 00:03:18.467
so I was trying to, like, take
weird objects

00:03:18.467 --> 00:03:20.434
and be, like, scanning, you
know, trying to, like --

00:03:20.434 --> 00:03:21.634
[ Laughter ]

00:03:21.634 --> 00:03:24.200
I kept looking over at his car
and trying to,

00:03:24.200 --> 00:03:25.868
you know,
look like that, but --

00:03:25.868 --> 00:03:27.467
-And how long ago was that?

00:03:27.467 --> 00:03:31.234
-That was a day after
the statute of limitations

00:03:31.234 --> 00:03:32.400
for getting in trouble

00:03:32.400 --> 00:03:33.934
for pretending
you're a police officer.

00:03:33.934 --> 00:03:35.367
[ Laughter ]

00:03:35.367 --> 00:03:38.701
-Well, thank you for celebrating
the day after our anniversary.

00:03:38.701 --> 00:03:40.601
-Yeah. Don't do that.
-Paula Pell!

00:03:40.601 --> 00:03:42.267
Don't do that.

00:03:42.267 --> 00:03:45.601
Paula Pell, "Girls5eva,"
streaming on Peacock.

00:03:45.601 --> 00:03:47.467
New episodes released
on Thursday.

